BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Introduction to Family Law with Downsview Community Legal Services
  (DCLS)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261013T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261013T150000
UID:6a47bdadb96ccc750c592a0c@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join Downsview Community Legal Services (DCLS) for legal infor
 mation sessions. Learn more about the law and discuss your legal rights. E
 ach session will explore a different topic.\nThis online workshop will rev
 iew the basics of Family Law\, including separation\, divorce\, custody\, 
 child support\, spousal support and domestic violence.\nRegistration:\nThi
 s virtual event is free to join and will take place on\nZoom\n. Register t
 o receive an email with details on how to join the session.\nThis program 
 will not be recorded.\nCaptions will be available.\nGetting Started with Z
 oom – Toronto Public Library Blog\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe p
 ersonal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Librar
 y under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The
  information will only be used for event and program registration\, delive
 ry and evaluation. Questions about how the library handles your informatio
 n can be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-59
 81\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a47bdadb96ccc750c592a0c
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
