UID:6a47c06de6e135e78be03878@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a lively discussion of Vincent Lam's\nOn the Ravin
 e\n.\nDr. Chen\, a downtown Toronto addictions doctor\, is on the devastat
 ing front line of the opioid crisis. Grappling with ever-more desperate ca
 ses that arrive in his waiting room\, he walks a tightrope between the hum
 an desires of his patients and the scientific doctrines of his profession.
 \nDrop-in.
LOCATION:Runnymede\, 2nd Floor Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a47c06de6e135e78be03878
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
